    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Mini golf that you play as a GOLFER!</strong></h2>Control your character in real-time. Feel free to go smack your friend or even their golf ball!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/065a5dc5f1bb0041d6eec959c1f94b36.poster.avif?t=1743849847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/065a5dc5f1bb0041d6eec959c1f94b36.webm?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/065a5dc5f1bb0041d6eec959c1f94b36.mp4?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 NO STROKE COUNT! It\u2019s all about speed!</strong></h2>Swing your golf club as many times as you want. The faster you complete, the better score you get.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/4cbd1c92f1b23b17075f328cbe6f68ef.poster.avif?t=1743849847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/4cbd1c92f1b23b17075f328cbe6f68ef.webm?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/4cbd1c92f1b23b17075f328cbe6f68ef.mp4?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 Here\u2019s your battlefi- uh... \u201cGolf Course\u201d.</strong></h2>Travel across the galaxy and venture into exotic courses on different planets. From a relaxing breezy cove to a fearful cemetery. There is no limit on where you can smack!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ccf3f7831a859247bbf2e94d26e67ce1.poster.avif?t=1743849847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ccf3f7831a859247bbf2e94d26e67ce1.webm?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ccf3f7831a859247bbf2e94d26e67ce1.mp4?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>\u2022 WACKY COSMETICS! Dress up by the way you want!</strong></h2>Put a taco on your head, Swing at your friends with a boba tea. Dress up by the way you want!<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ae1332acca471ba3179c49c9b3b03d9e.poster.avif?t=1743849847\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ae1332acca471ba3179c49c9b3b03d9e.webm?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2550840/extras/ae1332acca471ba3179c49c9b3b03d9e.mp4?t=1743849847\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
